Oh my god, Lasha. Roman, I have photos and I could share them with you. Okay, okay. God, Lasha. I have photos and I could share them with you. Okay, okay. But I feel like I almost don't need to. You can imagine. No, I got it. So it was actually found that the population of feral dogs across India increased by 5.5

